## 🚀 Running the Analysis Notebooks

The notebooks are designed to run on **Google Colab**:

1. Upload the contents of `microservices-demo/raw-data/` to Google Drive under:
   ```
   MyDrive/comp6910/
   ```
2. Open `Minikube_data_analysis.ipynb` or `GKE_data_analysis.ipynb` in Google Colab
3. Run all cells

